yaml/sequence
description: Ordered collection of values
- >
  A **sequence** is an ordered collection. It comes in two concretes - the dash-led block
  spelling and the bracketed flow one. An element can be ANY YAML value - the grammar
  recurses here. See the subchapters below:
- *: 00-yaml_sequence_block
- *: 01-yaml_sequence_flow
- *..:..
